{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.32},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.68,"end":28.48},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30.32,"end":39.76}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.92,"text":"平均斜率是兩點的高度差除以水平距離差；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.64,"end":7.84,"text":"切線斜率則描述局部的極限方向。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.48,"end":10.24,"text":"高點可能有零斜率，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.64,"end":14.32,"text":"因此高度和陡峭程度是不同的測量。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.68,"end":19.84,"text":"檢查曲線上 x = −1、0、1 的位置。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.72,"end":22.48,"text":"找出切線水平的位置，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.773,"end":25.6,"text":"以及斜率改變正負號的位置。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.04,"end":28.48,"text":"負斜率表示什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30.32,"end":31.68,"text":"負斜率表示什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.8,"end":36.8,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.2,"end":39.76,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}